we're not on the same wavelength here, so let's clear the air ...

if you want to paralyze the wizard and have it work you must:

1) never have killed him in that game.  once you kill the wizard
    he will _always_ come back at some point.

2) throw a potion of paralysis at him and hope it works long enough
    for you to leave the level (with THE amulet, that could be tricky).

3) leave the level while the wizard is paralyzed.  he won't follow
    you (until the final challenge ...).

i think that's it ...

